  {
    "sha": "2e20bbba11e3f6b652c9fcf07b82b95d37a59fdd",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVVonwNoAKDJlMjBiYmJhMTFlM2Y2YjY1MmM5ZmNmMDdiODJiOTVkMzdhNTlmZGQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-07T21:34:57Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-07T21:34:57Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): ask to save unsaved changes before close, New and Open\n\nThe command history now records its position at the last save or load\n(History::mark_clean / History::is_dirty): the document is dirty when\nthe position differs, so undoing back to the saved point is clean again\nand a redo past it is dirty again; a new command over a saved point on\nthe redo stack makes it unreachable. Ephemeral state never dirties it.\n\nThe window title leads with '*' while dirty. The window X now queues a\nQuit like Ctrl+Q; Quit, New and Open (dialog) over a dirty document are\nheld and an egui Modal asks Save / Don't Save / Cancel, answered through\nthe queue (CommandKind::ResolveUnsaved). A cancelled or failed save\nkeeps the document and the app open.\n\nFixes #107\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
